{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41215","headline":"梁郊祀乐章 庆熙 · 张衮","name":"梁郊祀乐章 庆熙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"哲后躬享，旨酒斯陈。\n王恭无斁，严祀惟寅。\n皇祖以配，大孝以振。\n宜锡景福，永休下民。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}